{"t": 551.14, "kind": "proposal", "iteration": 2, "k": 1, "move": "new_topology", "name": "SECE_Improved", "rationale": "The previous SSHI_FBR_Zener design suffered from excessive voltage drops across the full-bridge rectifier, which limited power delivery under heavy loads (S2) and weak excitations (S4). To solve this, I am implementing a Synchronous Electric Charge Extraction (SECE) topology. In SECE, the energy stored in the piezo capacitance Cp is transferred to the output capacitor Cout through an inductor L and a single diode D at each of the piezo voltage peaks. This reduces the rectification loss to a single diode drop and avoids the continuous conduction losses of a bridge. This should significantly increase vavg for S2 and S4. I've included a Zener clamp for protection and a storage capacitor for ripple and stability.", "circuit": {"move": "new_topology", "name": "SECE_Improved", "rationale": "The previous SSHI_FBR_Zener design suffered from excessive voltage drops across the full-bridge rectifier, which limited power delivery under heavy loads (S2) and weak excitations (S4). To solve this, I am implementing a Synchronous Electric Charge Extraction (SECE) topology. In SECE, the energy stored in the piezo capacitance Cp is transferred to the output capacitor Cout through an inductor L and a single diode D at each of the piezo voltage peaks. This reduces the rectification loss to a single diode drop and avoids the continuous conduction losses of a bridge. This should significantly increase vavg for S2 and S4. I've included a Zener clamp for protection and a storage capacitor for ripple and stability.", "done": false, "components": [{"id": "S1", "type": "S", "nodes": ["pzp", "n1"], "ctrl": "G1"}, {"id": "S2", "type": "S", "nodes": ["pzn", "n1"], "ctrl": "G2"}, {"id": "L1", "type": "L", "nodes": ["n1", "n2"], "value": 0.01}, {"id": "D1", "type": "D", "nodes": ["n2", "out"], "model": "DSCH"}, {"id": "G1", "type": "SYNC", "ton": 5e-05, "phase": 0.0, "edges": "pos"}, {"id": "G2", "type": "SYNC", "ton": 5e-05, "phase": 0.0, "edges": "neg"}, {"id": "C1", "type": "C", "nodes": ["out", "0"], "value": 2.2e-05}, {"id": "DZ1", "type": "D", "nodes": ["0", "out"], "model": "DZ33"}]}}
